(2 < 9) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['Yes, nine is less than ten.']. }.
(9 < 2) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['My logic fails']. }.
Tawm sau-ntawv: (-2 + 6).
Tawm sau-ntawv: (-3 - -3).
>> TrueIsNice := 3.
Tawm sau-ntawv: TrueIsNice.
>> FalseIsBad := ['Not true!'].
Tawm sau-ntawv: FalseIsBad.
>> NilIsEmpty := ['Yep'].
Tawm sau-ntawv: NilIsEmpty.
